{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13459","headline":"越中问海客 · 刘眘虚","name":"越中问海客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雨沧洲暮，一帆今始归。\n自云发南海，万里速如飞。\n初谓落何处，永将无所依。\n冥茫渐西见，山色越中微。\n谁念去时远，人经此路稀。\n泊舟悲且泣，使我亦沾衣。\n浮海焉用说，忆乡难久违。\n纵爲鲁连子，山路有柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}